    "description": {
      "value": "This volatile-looking bomb is cobbled together from jagged metal scrap, broken glass, and other bits of razor-sharp fragments, lashed around a core of explosive alchemical slag. A junk bomb deals the listed slashing damage, persistent bleed damage, and piercing splash damage. Many types grant an item bonus to attack rolls. You gain a +3 item bonus to attack rolls. The bomb deals 4d8 slashing damage, 4 persistent bleed damage, and 4 piercing splash damage."
